{"hw":"λογάω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">λογάω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">λογάω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be fond of talking</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Luc.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lex.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">15</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <span class=\"gk\">λογάω</span> or <span class=\"gk\">λογέω</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">3</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">sg.</span> <span class=\"gk\">λογήσει</span>, perh. <b class=\"lex-tr\">will take account</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Tyrt.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.42</span> </span> Diehl.</div></div>"}